{"id":"bb165f3d0daa89fc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/252_简单类型集合论_TST.md","title":"252 简单类型集合论 TST","display":"252_简单类型集合论_TST","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-类型与符号表\">1. 类型与符号表</h1>\n<p>类型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_{TST}=\\mathbb N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ty}_{TST}=\\mathbb N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>；不同类型层的变量集合两两不交：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ne k\">\\(n\\ne k\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_k^{TST}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_k^{TST}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 型变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}=\\{v_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}=\\{v_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_{TST}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_{TST}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\)</span> 有限，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{TST}(n,X)=v_m^n,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{TST}(n,X)=v_m^n,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_m^n\\notin X\">\\(v_m^n\\notin X\\)</span> 的最小自然数。</p>\n<p>项构造子只有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\doteq_n t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\in_n t,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\doteq_n t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\in_n t,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\equiv\\neg A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\equiv A\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n(x,A)\\equiv\\forall_n x\\,A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\equiv\\neg A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\equiv A\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n(x,A)\\equiv\\forall_n x\\,A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义缩写：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists_n x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_n x\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B:=(A\\to B)\\wedge(B\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists_n x\\,A:=\\neg\\forall_n x\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-类型化项\">2. 类型化项</h1>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{var}_n(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{var}_n(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{TST}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}_{TST}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\)</span>，写</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ty}_{TST}(t)=n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ty}_{TST}(t)=n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为显式记录原子式的类型形成限制，定义元语言谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqOK}_{TST}(n,s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqOK}_{TST}(n,s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MemOK}_{TST}(n,s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\wedge\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MemOK}_{TST}(n,s,t):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\wedge\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-公式\">3. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合。</p>\n<p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\doteq_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\\quad t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST},\\quad t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{n+1}^{TST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\in_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\in_n t\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\quad A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\quad A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_n x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_n x\\,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由变量、替换与-alpha-等价\">4. 自由变量、替换与 alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(\\operatorname{var}_n(x))=\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(\\operatorname{var}_n(x))=\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(s\\in_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(s\\in_n t)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(\\neg A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(\\neg A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A\\to B)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A\\to B)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{TST})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_{TST})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(s\\in_n t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(s\\doteq_n t)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(s\\in_n t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A\\to B)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A\\to B)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(\\forall_n x\\,A)\n=\\operatorname{BV}_{TST}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义同类型项替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}:\n\\bigcup_{n,k\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{TST}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}:\n\\bigcup_{n,k\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})\n\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{TST}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\operatorname{var}_k(y)\">\\(r=\\operatorname{var}_k(y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\">\\(s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;k=n\\text{ 且 }x=y,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}_k(y),&amp;k\\ne n\\text{ 或 }x\\ne y.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;k=n\\text{ 且 }x=y,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}_k(y),&amp;k\\ne n\\text{ 或 }x\\ne y.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\">\\(r\\in\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r[x:=s]\\in\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\">\\(r[x:=s]\\in\\mathsf{Term}_k^{TST}\\)</span>；替换不会跨越类型层。</p>\n<p>定义公式替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}:\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})\n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r\\doteq_k t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\doteq_k t[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r\\doteq_k t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\doteq_k t[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(r\\in_k t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\in_k t[x:=s],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(r\\in_k t)[x:=s]=r[x:=s]\\in_k t[x:=s],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=s]=A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall_k y\\,A\">\\(C=\\forall_k y\\,A\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y=x\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_k y\\,A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y=x\\Rightarrow C[x:=s]=\\forall_k y\\,A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\\forall_k y\\,(A[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\\forall_k y\\,(A[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{TST}\n\\bigl(k,\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\n\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_k^{TST}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\n\\operatorname{fresh}_{TST}\n\\bigl(k,\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST}(s)\n\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_k^{TST}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\\forall_k z\\,((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_k(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\\forall_k z\\,((A[y:=\\operatorname{var}_k(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\)</span>，定义同类型自由变量改名</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TST}(A,x,y)\n:=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TST}(A,x,y)\n:=A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\forall_n x\\,B\">\\(A=\\forall_n x\\,B\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(B)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TST}(A,x,y)\n:=\\forall_n y\\,(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TST}(A,x,y)\n:=\\forall_n y\\,(B[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span> 上所有满足下列条件的等价关系的交集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_n\">\\(\\forall_n\\)</span> 相容。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_n x\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}\n\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_n x\\,A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}\n\\forall_n y\\,(A[x:=\\operatorname{var}_n(y)]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TST}\n=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TST}\n=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TST}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TST}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TST}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{TST}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TST}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{TST}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TST}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{TST}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TST}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,1}^{TST}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,A)\\to A[x:=t]:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nt\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TST}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_n x\\,B):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall,2}^{TST}=\\{(\\forall_n x\\,(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall_n x\\,B):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TST}=\\{t\\doteq_n t:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,1}^{TST}=\\{t\\doteq_n t:n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TST}=\\{(t\\doteq_n u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nt,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=,2}^{TST}=\\{(t\\doteq_n u)\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\\\nt,u\\in\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>外延公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{TST}\n=\n\\{(\\forall_n z\\,(z\\in_n x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_n y))\\to x\\doteq_{n+1} y:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TST},\\\nz\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{TST}\n=\n\\{(\\forall_n z\\,(z\\in_n x\\leftrightarrow z\\in_n y))\\to x\\doteq_{n+1} y:\nn\\in\\mathbb N,\\\nx,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TST},\\\nz\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义理解模式的类型与新鲜性条件</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}(n,A,x,y):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\wedge\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\wedge y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TST}\\wedge\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}(n,A,x,y):\\Longleftrightarrow\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\wedge A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\wedge\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\wedge y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{n+1}^{TST}\\wedge\ny\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>理解公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TST}\n=\n\\{\\exists_{n+1} y\\,\\forall_n x\\,(x\\in_n y\\leftrightarrow A):\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}(n,A,x,y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TST}\n=\n\\{\\exists_{n+1} y\\,\\forall_n x\\,(x\\in_n y\\leftrightarrow A):\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}(n,A,x,y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TST}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{TST}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TST}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Log}^{TST}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ext}^{TST}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Comp}^{TST}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则与证明\">6. 推理规则与证明</h1>\n<p>显示规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_n x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall_n x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A),\\forall_n x\\,A):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A),\\forall_n x\\,A):\nn\\in\\mathbb N,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TST}\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},A\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)\">\\(A_k=(A_j\\to A_i)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall_n x\\,A_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall_n x\\,A_j\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(G)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{G\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST}(G)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST}A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{TST}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{TST}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个形式系统\">7. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>目标差异：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 型变量、项、等词与量词都停留在同一层；成员原子只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 型项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 型项，同类型替换保持所在层不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}\">\\(\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST}\\)</span> 又把理解模式的被定义变量固定在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 层、对象变量固定在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层并要求新鲜性。系统不加入无穷公理、urelement 谓词或类型歧义公理。</p>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{TST}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ty}_{TST},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{EqOK}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{MemOK}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TST},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST},\n\\vdash_{TST}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{TST}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ty}_{TST},\n(\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n(\\mathsf{Term}_n^{TST})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{EqOK}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{MemOK}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf T}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf F}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{TST},\n\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{TST},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{CompOK}_{TST},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{TST},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}^{TST},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{TST},\n\\vdash_{TST}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含简单类型成员语言、类型化外延与理解、公理集合、推理规则和证明关系；不含无类型成员、urelement 谓词、类型歧义公理、解释结构、语义满足、模型类、模型满足关系、真值定义或元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-类型与符号表","text":"1. 类型与符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-类型化项","text":"2. 类型化项","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式","text":"3. 公式","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由变量、替换与-alpha-等价","text":"4. 自由变量、替换与 alpha 等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则与证明","text":"6. 推理规则与证明","level":1},{"id":"7.-整个形式系统","text":"7. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_{TST}=\\mathbb N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ne k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}_k^{TST}=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}=\\{v_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_{TST}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_n^{TST}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_{TST}(n,X)=v_m^n,","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"v_m^n\\notin X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eq}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n,\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eq}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\doteq_n t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{mem}_n(s,t)\\equiv s\\in_n t,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\equiv\\neg A,\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\equiv A\\to B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{all}_n(x,A)\\equiv\\forall_n x\\,A.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\wedge B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\vee B:=\\neg A\\to B,